  <note class="self-check" id="sect-00001"><para id="para-00001">Jose created a function \(W(h)\) for the weight, \(W\), of his family members given their height, \(h\), in inches.</para>
<para id="para-00002">Which of the following provides a group of possible inputs for the function?</para></section>
